## SQ-VH-01 | Done, no Visceral Heap mixin or BOP load error
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject Mixin apply.*failed|Couldn't load tag.*biomesoplenty|Failed to load.*biomesoplenty|InvalidMixin|Critical injection failure
> say vh01

## SQ-VH-02 | Visceral Heap kept counts; BOP blocks in the registry
shell grep "Visceral Heap: kept" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-400
> zq blocktag minecraft:mineable/hoe
shell grep -c "biomesoplenty" logs/latest.log
