> zq count {H1-16} 90 {H3-16} {H1+16} 126 {H3+16} biomesoplenty:flesh minecraft:the_nether
> zq count {H1-16} 1 {H3-16} {H1+16} 126 {H3+16} minecraft:netherrack minecraft:the_nether
